# Temporary whole-site password wall while the site is still being built out
# in Prismic. This ships with every deploy (this file lives in public/, which
# Astro copies as-is into dist/, so it lands at the docroot root on every
# push) — no need to ever redo this by hand in cPanel again. Matches the
# credentials set up via cPanel's Directory Privacy tool; the actual password
# lives only in the AuthUserFile below, never in this repo.
#
# TODO: remove this whole file once the site is ready for real visitors.
AuthType Basic
AuthName "UnderConstruction"
AuthUserFile "/home/thefuytb/.htpasswds/avainrva.com/passwd"
Require valid-user
